{"c":[{"id":"161e94da3b50d407","sum":"SumMem@78d91b7: one repo-root store, no scoped stores. always-tdd/preflight scope (#116): product-delivered or product-runtime behavior a product user would observe breaking; no tool or category exclusion lists (they get relabeled); no second definition in preflight.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"7d52b47ec9e85065","sum":"SumMem@78d91b7: one repo-root store; no scoped stores. TDD/preflight judge product-delivered or product-runtime behavior, not whatever a package manager or Actions runner executes (#116); prefer one steering principle over a tool exclusion list.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T203140Z-2cd50a583de58b13","text":"SumMem installed from Texarkanine/SumMem@78d91b7; one store only (repo-root .summem). Do not start scoped stores.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T203952Z-b85700bde1651227","text":"TDD/preflight must judge product-delivered or product-runtime behavior, not whatever a package manager or Actions runner executes (#116). Prefer one steering principle over an exclusion list of tools.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4caf0939404591cd","sum":"always-tdd scope (#116): the product's executable behavior, judged by whether a product user would observe the break. No excluded-tool or category lists (they get relabeled, lint is a CLI); no second definition echoed into preflight.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T204108Z-bdc4405c71cbf0c8","text":"always-tdd in-scope is the product's executable behavior; delete 'If something executes it'. Do not list excluded tools or echo a second definition into preflight (#116).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T204616Z-1620ce6f602992b6","text":"Category lists in always-tdd get relabeled (lint is a CLI). Scope by 'would a user of the product observe the break' matches the change-detector test; #116 shipped the smaller 'product's executable behavior' prefix instead.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"c19949f5dfc60d8e","sum":"#116/#117 tdd: bug-fixes/20260820-tdd-product-scope.md. #118 txrk9: rules/txrk9-basic-pr-review/SKILL.md, features/20260824-txrk9-pr-review.md. Names actions, not tool ids. Other=closed hunt + split-confidence omit; silence only after cull; do not merge with pr-feedback-judge.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"5202cd818d3f1b9a","sum":"tdd-product-scope archived as bug-fixes/20260820-tdd-product-scope.md (#116, PR #117). txrk9-pr-review: Other sensitivity is a closed hunt plus a split confidence omit; silence is success only after that cull; do not merge with pr-feedback-judge.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T204959Z-dd7f3dfe96e57256","text":"Archived tdd-product-scope as bug-fixes/20260820-tdd-product-scope.md (#116 / PR #117). One-sentence always-tdd steer; niko-preflight untouched; live proof is the next lint-only or invoke-only-CI preflight.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260824T194427Z-3aac0651e5d3eb24","text":"txrk9-pr-review: Other sensitivity is a closed hunt plus a split confidence omit; silence is success only after that cull. Do not merge with pr-feedback-judge.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"b6d65b1dc5295d16","sum":"pr-review skill names posting actions, not Cursor tool identifiers. txrk9-pr-review archived as features/20260824-txrk9-pr-review.md; skill is rules/txrk9-basic-pr-review/SKILL.md (PR #118).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260824T200408Z-46497ed70935ab07","text":"pr-review skill names posting actions, not Cursor tool identifiers.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260824T203402Z-5b4dd72596686af3","text":"Archived txrk9-pr-review as memory-bank/archive/features/20260824-txrk9-pr-review.md; skill is rules/txrk9-basic-pr-review/SKILL.md (PR #118).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
